    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo is now available!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note:\u00a0Languages other than Chinese and English are machine translated. Please feel free to provide feedback if there are any issues!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/077139cf1a9e27103db82eaca0b477d1.poster.avif?t=1753760389\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/077139cf1a9e27103db82eaca0b477d1.webm?t=1753760389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/077139cf1a9e27103db82eaca0b477d1.mp4?t=1753760389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Midnight Billiards</strong> is a <strong>turn-based</strong> <strong>roguelite</strong> game inspired by <i>Peglin</i> and billiards. Your goal is to bounce\u00a0 the ball\u00a0strategically  across the pool, triggering various post effects along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each game, you\u2019ll collect various items to deck-build your own unique playstyle. Spend your money in the shop to purchase items. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll encounter all kinds of characters and mini-challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimately, you\u2019ll face the boss of the building and strive to become the King of Midnight!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rotate and Shoot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/40a996443cea6d9284e8022d2ce14b00.poster.avif?t=1753760389\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/40a996443cea6d9284e8022d2ce14b00.webm?t=1753760389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/40a996443cea6d9284e8022d2ce14b00.mp4?t=1753760389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various Pool Tables for Various PlayStyles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/53b85a34cad3633d5a8d0bcb0198db0e.poster.avif?t=1753760389\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/53b85a34cad3633d5a8d0bcb0198db0e.webm?t=1753760389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/53b85a34cad3633d5a8d0bcb0198db0e.mp4?t=1753760389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect Items and Deck-build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/dfa48f90ff9f06749d9bdd6963bca1db.poster.avif?t=1753760389\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/dfa48f90ff9f06749d9bdd6963bca1db.webm?t=1753760389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/dfa48f90ff9f06749d9bdd6963bca1db.mp4?t=1753760389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying impact effects for an exciting gameplay experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of selectable characters, each with unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different customizable pool for various playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of unique items to mix and match for endless combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replayability with procedurally generated maps to challenge your skills.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo is now available!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note:\u00a0Languages other than Chinese and English are machine translated. Please feel free to provide feedback if there are any issues!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/077139cf1a9e27103db82eaca0b477d1.poster.avif?t=1753760389\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/077139cf1a9e27103db82eaca0b477d1.webm?t=1753760389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/077139cf1a9e27103db82eaca0b477d1.mp4?t=1753760389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Midnight Billiards</strong> is a <strong>turn-based</strong> <strong>roguelite</strong> game inspired by <i>Peglin</i> and billiards. Your goal is to bounce\u00a0 the ball\u00a0strategically  across the pool, triggering various post effects along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each game, you\u2019ll collect various items to deck-build your own unique playstyle. Spend your money in the shop to purchase items. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll encounter all kinds of characters and mini-challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimately, you\u2019ll face the boss of the building and strive to become the King of Midnight!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rotate and Shoot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/40a996443cea6d9284e8022d2ce14b00.poster.avif?t=1753760389\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://